#: ../../../../docs/development/index.md:8
msgid "维护平台与文档"
msgstr "Maintain the platform and documentation"

#: ../../../../docs/development/index.md:10
msgid "平台贡献保留既有 C11、格式与注释合同，新行为执行真实 RED／GREEN。 按当前任务进入工具、依赖、SDK 或文档流程。"
msgstr ""
"Platform contributions preserve existing C11, formatting and comment "
"contracts. New behavior executes real RED/GREEN. Enter the tool, dependency,"
" SDK or documentation workflow appropriate to the task."

#: ../../../../docs/development/index.md:25
msgid ""
"只开发外部应用时先看[应用指南](../guides/index.md)；公共状态与字段见 "
"[参考合同](../reference/contracts/index.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For external application development, start with the [application "
"guides](../guides/index.md). Public states and fields are defined in the "
"[reference contracts](../reference/contracts/index.md)."
